#: AdminGuide.php:228
msgid ""
"Embeddings do not train AI weights. They are numerical representations of text used to find "
"semantically similar passages. They are billed separately and may be sent even when external chat"
" is disabled if semantic search is enabled. The chat request limit does not cap embedding costs. "
"Disable semantic search to stop these requests."
msgstr ""
