"second timeout per URL, without visitor cookies or redirects. A changed or inaccessible source is"
" omitted until its public content matches the index again. Temporary HTTP 403, 429, 5xx or "
"network errors pause crawling without discarding the queued URLs. Resume after resolving the "
"error."
